OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits punching former boxing
OL,4,Aworld champion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted punching former
OL,7,Fboxing world champion Joe Cordina
OL,8,Foutside a Cardiff petrol station.
OL,10,FJamie O'Brien, 33, from Pentwyn spoke
OL,11,Fto confirm his name, date of birth and
OL,12,Faddress at Cardiff Magistrates' Court
OL,13,Fand pleaded guilty to assaulting
OL,14,FCordina by beating.
OL,16,FIt happened at a Texaco garage in
OL,17,FPentwyn in February.
OL,19,FO'Brien was given a conditional
OL,20,Fdischarge and ordered to pay #85 court
OL,21,Fcosts and pay a mandatory surcharge of
OL,22,F#26.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
